But one thing Greg said in his interview really piqued my curiosity.
但格雷格在采访中说的一件事真的引起了我的好奇。

258
00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:56.620
I mean, there were so many things, but he said that, you know, this storyline wasn't cut until
我是说，有很多事，但他提到，你知道，这个剧情直到

